WEBVTT

00:53:59.579 --> 00:54:04.496
That's the whole goal of a sandwich for
me is to make every bit as much like

00:54:05.246 --> 00:54:08.996
the previous bite as possible. OK,
consistency.

00:54:09.371 --> 00:54:12.288
So you put the you know, whatever
whatever you're putting on it,

00:54:12.288 --> 00:54:14.288
it has to be uniformly applied everywhere.

00:54:14.829 --> 00:54:16.913
Burritos also sometimes have this problem.

00:54:16.913 --> 00:54:20.204
If people don't do the burrito correctly,
it's just tacos.

00:54:20.288 --> 00:54:24.454
Yeah, absolutely. Yeah. So this
is my last question, Cheryl.

00:54:24.454 --> 00:54:27.204
What is the thing you want
to do most next?

00:54:28.663 --> 00:54:33.996
Finish my next book, I really
am ready to do that.